{"page":391,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:44","surah":28,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كُنتَ بِجَانِبِ ٱلْغَرْبِىِّ إِذْ قَضَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَى ٱلْأَمْرَ وَمَا كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلشَّـٰهِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You [Muhammad] were not present on the western side of the mountain when We gave Our command to Moses: you were not there-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِجَانِبِ","en_gloss":"on (the) side","transliteration":"bijānibi","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْغَرْبِىِّ","en_gloss":"western","transliteration":"l-gharbiyi","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَضَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We decreed","transliteration":"qaḍaynā","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُوسَى","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرَ","en_gloss":"the Commandment","transliteration":"l-amra","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلشَّـٰهِدِينَ","en_gloss":"the witnesses","transliteration":"l-shāhidīna","verse_key":"28:44"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:44"}]},{"verse_key":"28:45","surah":28,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّآ أَنشَأْنَا قُرُونًا فَتَطَاوَلَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْعُمُرُ ۚ وَمَا كُنتَ ثَاوِيًا فِىٓ أَهْلِ مَدْيَنَ تَتْلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتِنَا وَلَـٰكِنَّا كُنَّا مُرْسِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have brought into being many generations who lived long lives- you did not live 