ah":46,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كُنتَ بِجَانِبِ ٱلطُّورِ إِذْ نَادَيْنَا وَلَـٰكِن رَّحْمَةً مِّن رَّبِّكَ لِتُنذِرَ قَوْمًا مَّآ أَتَىٰهُم مِّن نَّذِيرٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"nor were you present on the side of Mount Sinai when We called out to Moses. But you too have been sent as an act of grace from your Lord, to give warning to a people to whom no warner has come before, so that they may take heed,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِجَانِبِ","en_gloss":"at (the) side","transliteration":"bijānibi","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلطُّورِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Tur","transliteration":"l-ṭūri","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَادَيْنَا","en_gloss":"We called","transliteration":"nādaynā","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَّحْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(as) a mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatan","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِتُنذِرَ","en_gloss":"so that you warn","transliteration":"litundhira","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّآ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَتَىٰهُم","en_gloss":"(had) come to them","transliteration":"atāhum","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":16,"ar":"نَّذِيرٍۢ","en_gloss":"warner","transliteration":"nadhīrin","verse_key":"28:46"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِّن